<div id="bk6921790" class="b-plain c-space_normal c-sp-space_normal c-sp-padding_normal cssskin-_block_billboard" data-bk-id="bk6921790">
<div class=" column -column1">
<div class="articleTitle">
<p class=" c-body">Tomodachi Autumun 2015</p>
<p class="c-lead">In this report we introduce the life and work of a friend of Japan.</p>
<h1 class=" c-page_title"><span>Friends of Japan</span></h1>
<h2 class=" c-title">A Focus on Women’s Advancement and Happiness for All</h2>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div id="bk6924670" class="b-plain c-space_normal c-sp-space_normal c-sp-padding_normal cssskin-_block_billboard" data-bk-id="bk6924670">
<div class=" column -column1">
<div class="articleNavi">
<div class="indexList">
<div class=" c-body">
<div class="c-img   ">
<a href="../../2015/autumn_2015/index_list.html" class="js-popup" data-width="800" data-height="2000" data-resize="true" data-pid="479432"><img src="../../_src/7939769/articlenaviindex.png?v=1578473167866" alt="" id="imgsrc7939769_1"></a>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<p class=" c-body"></p>
